{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape the Tower is a horror game where you must escape from a 600-meter-high radio tower within 10 minutes.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist wakes up to find themselves on a 600-meter-high radio tower. The time limit is 10 minutes. Use your wits to escape the tower!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize the items left in the tower and think strategically to make your escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ending</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fb3 Normal Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fb1 Hidden Ending</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can experience all endings in about 50 minutes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Developer's Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game was developed by a 15-year-old solo developer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Video Posting Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both individuals and organizations can post and stream videos without prior permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, please adhere to the following guidelines:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Include the game's name in the video title.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While optional, we would appreciate it if you could include a link to the Steam page in the video description.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RAYBIS GAMES is not responsible for any damages caused by posting or streaming gameplay videos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These guidelines are subject to change without notice.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"BAD END1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3430780/5ed11e2a0075caa23f442cd47d2c4eb0657ac292.jpg"},{"name":"BAD END2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/ap